description:
Get a steady handhold without giving up style: this 24-inch wall-mount solid brass grab bar combines a camouflage pattern with industrial pipe-fitting details for a farmhouse look that stands out.
{FINISH_SENTENCE}
Part of the Allied Brass Camo Collection, the camo pattern is applied with protective materials to keep a decorative, clean finish. Solid brass construction is designed for corrosion-free and rust-free performance, making it a smart choice when you want durable bathroom fixtures that still read as designer bathroom hardware. Grab bars help maintain balance, minimize fatigue, and provide a sense of security in and around the bathroom—useful for elders, children, caregivers assisting transfers, or anyone who wants added stability near the tub, shower, or toilet. This piece installs as wall mounted bath accessories with color-coordinated mounting hardware; grab bar and all installation hardware are included, and no assembly is required. Backed by a limited lifetime warranty.
